                    "@type": "Question",
                    "name": "How can I manage my business from the Mindbody Business app?",
                    "acceptedAnswer": {
                        "@type": "Answer",
                        "text": "The Mindbody Business app enables you and your staff to manage operations on the go. You can: Add new clients, take photos, and capture signatures for liability waiversAccess client account and profile informationBrowse your staff scheduleSign clients in to classes and coursesBook, edit, and cancel appointments and check clients inAccept payment for appointments without being at the deskSell products, services, and contractsProcess purchases using the same payment methods available on your Mindbody business siteLogin is the same across the Business app and desktop experiences"
