                    "@type": "Question",
                    "name": "Which third-party tools can I connect to Mindbody?",
                    "acceptedAnswer": {
                        "@type": "Answer",
                        "text": "Mindbody connects with a variety of third-party tools to help you run and grow your business. These include: Payroll tools such as ADP, Exact Payroll, and Paychex, which let you send payroll data directly from Mindbody.Door access systems that manage entry to your studio or gym, including turnstiles, doors, and lock hardware.Marketing and lead generation tools like Constant Contact, Mailchimp, Perkville, Meta Ads, and Google Ads, helping you run email campaigns, loyalty programs, and digital advertising.Additional services including Spivi (performance tracking and leaderboards), Bitlancer (late cancel and no-show fee processing),Trainerize (digital coaching), Spafinder (gift cards), and LiveEdit (community and website tools)."
