                    "@type": "Question",
                    "name": "How can I automate payment issues and collections in Mindbody?",
                    "acceptedAnswer": {
                        "@type": "Answer",
                        "text": "Mindbody offers several tools to help you automate parts of your payments and collections process: You can automatically notify clients about failed or expiring payments through built-in auto emails, and use reports like Autopay Detail and Credit Card Expirations to quickly identify issues and follow up. Chargebacks can be tracked and managed and declined autopays can be converted into account balances that you can monitor and collect. While some actions-like responding to disputes or processing outstanding balances-still require manual steps, Mindbody streamlines most of the tracking and client communication so you can manage payment issues and collections more efficiently."
